### Item 4 — Make the Wheeler–DeWitt resolution rigorous

**Placement:** §5.1, immediately after the Born–Oppenheimer factorization paragraph.

**Action:** Add a rigorous statement of the inner product, the domain, and normalizability, plus a direct comparison with Page–Wootters and the relational-time literature.

